<description>&lt;p&gt;Egypt reopened its embassy in Tripoli after a 12‑year closure, restoring diplomatic presence in Libya. A UK court upheld a decision against the government in a case involving a Syrian asylum seeker kidnapped in Libya. The 22nd meeting of the Sahel-Saharan bloc’s Executive Council was held in Tripoli, bringing regional officials to the capital. Russia and Libya discussed bilateral trade and investment in an October 2026 update. Combat intensity remains low, with 2 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNQW1iNndNcXdOam1DRURFeDl2cExCRk43QXZVX3BUUnRBeWFDa2hTS1AzNnkteGFvUEJrRG5rek1nQlpGRkdMTURyOWFNcDFqc0xQLUpER0o3dElzMUxXSFJQMEwxSlE5ODVPVjZtTkFobHN1cUhMYkVlbHF0LXpRNldTdFhvMEN5SzVpYVJrQ1lSQ2hMWm5INkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPTlN4Z0NvUnBzSnd0SG9fbUx5Z25Xb19YalJBalpPVHpXZ29BUHJUem9aYTZWZkYwOGZxU1pwRXJvWEMweFhjQ0RIcWcwcHZHdUFIMXRSZHY0ZlZwZXh2bGFvTTJaUTB2OGV4SFdDX3h1YTh0clpIYU1JaWdEMk5LaUVsRlFnbzA2SWhybHR3RGcyemZlZUFj?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxQNG52bU1WZjdNSXhVX0hOVUZ1MDY3STNaRVg5VXBrRzBZSFN3Zk9UOHk2eHg1QnlNY09uNndTOUFLclhvWWR2NGpHVWFJNmNQR3JER1JtOHh2T29LZGxvS0lqVThoWVVoQ0FTTEpSamFHZVhxUm4tbHJmSkxnWjN3MmhMX3BMd21G?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sada Elbalad English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNekE1c2hGRXBFeTlNOXVxQnpBOUVYeFl3Ulh0RVpzOHN6a2ZMU0kxUGJUQWtBY2xCaDJENHRtZVdPWGxjdnFMVWhwbkZ2OWt5U1lVdi1wNVdYQUJzQlNpLVFoSlVuV2pzLWR3cjRpRGp6SDJQN1ZJNkl0M3Y1b3J2VU5VSWt2em1CZ0pRbVJCaV9ELTRoS2l6Yjc0VVo3WDQ4eWJWN05vLWY?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sada Elbalad English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quo